        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的終端機"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command is typed into the terminal and waits for you to press Return.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令会被输入到终端中，等待你按下 Return 键。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指令會輸入到終端機中，等待你按下 Return 鍵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host key has changed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "host key 已变更"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "host key 已變更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key can only be used after a successful biometric or passcode check, and becomes unusable if the device's biometric enrolment changes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此密钥只有在生物识别或设备密码验证通过后才能使用；如果设备上录入的生物识别信息发生变化，此密钥将无法再使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此金鑰只有在生物辨識或裝置密碼驗證通過後才能使用；若裝置上註冊的生物辨識資料變更，此金鑰將無法再使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The private key is removed from this device and any connection using it will stop working. This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥将从本设备移除，所有使用它的连接都将无法继续工作。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰將從本裝置移除，所有使用它的連線都將無法繼續運作。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key is encrypted. The passphrase is used once to unlock it and is not stored.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此密钥已加密。密码短语仅用于解锁一次，不会被存储。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此金鑰已加密。密碼短語僅用於解鎖一次，不會被儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes your connections, private keys and Cloudflare sessions from this device. It cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将从本设备移除你的连接、私钥和 Cloudflare 会话。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這將從本裝置移除你的連線、私密金鑰和 Cloudflare 工作階段。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server has not been seen before. Check that the fingerprint below matches the server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此前从未见过该服务器。请核对下方的 fingerprint 与服务器上的是否一致。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先前從未見過此伺服器。請核對下方的 fingerprint 與伺服器上的是否一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
