    "When a connection drops, SuperTerminal retries on its own and as soon as the network comes back. Your scrollback is kept, and the new shell is marked in the terminal — it starts fresh, in the home directory, with nothing running.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接断开时，SuperTerminal 会自行重试，并在网络恢复后立即重试。回滚记录会保留，新的 shell 会在终端中标出——它是全新的，位于主目录，没有任何程序在运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連線中斷時，SuperTerminal 會自行重試，並在網路恢復後立即重試。回捲紀錄會保留，新的 shell 會在終端機中標示出來——它是全新的，位於主目錄，沒有任何程式在執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
